  "title": "Plane Rude: The modern in-flight habits testing passengers’ patience",
  "summary": "New Booking.com research reveals the in-flight habits passengers can't stand - from window photo-leaners (42%), to filming TikToks (33%) and even doing manicures mid-flight (23%).*Nearly half (44%) say flyers are getting \"too comfortable\" at 30,000ft yet two thirds (67%) admit they act the same as they do at home.A third (31%) suffer in silence ...",
